  "description": "Mie Goreng, meaning 'fried noodles', is a much-loved Indonesian street speciality that has become a favourite in homes worldwide. Our version includes tofu and it delivers the perfect ratio of sweet to salty flavours making this a truly delicious mid-week dinner. We’ve replaced the broccoli florets in this recipe with green beans due to local ingredient availability. It’ll be just as delicious, just follow your recipe card!",
