  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• In a small bowl, combine oyster sauce, kecap manis, vegetable stock, the soy sauce, vinegar and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d6cf7d5496ac4a64bb9/step-b8eb2300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiled water. Add egg noodles and cook over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside. TIP: Add a dash of water to help speed up the cooking process.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d6cf7d5496ac4a64bb9/step-5b0d1810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets.Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook broccoli and carrot, tossing, until tender, 6-8 minutes.\n• Transfer to a bowl. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d6cf7d5496ac4a64bb9/step-e2a7c720.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, crack the eggs into the pan. Cook until egg whites are firm and yolks are cooked to liking, 4-5 minutes.\n• Transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d6cf7d5496ac4a64bb9/step-98d6c030.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add cooked noodles and veggies to pan, then add sauce mixture, tossing until combined, 1 minute.\n• Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d6cf7d5496ac4a64bb9/step-d3e92140.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pork and veggie mie goreng between bowls.\n• Top each bowl with a fried egg, crispy shallots and chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d6cf7d5496ac4a64bb9/step-34a49c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
